{
  "_readme": [
    "Reusable product-artwork pool for the catalog seed (Phase 5).",
    "Every entry is a real file in frontend/public/products/ and is served by the",
    "frontend bundle as /products/<file>. The seed only ever builds image_url values",
    "from this manifest, and fails the run if a product category maps to a missing or",
    "empty group. frontend/tests/image-pool.spec.js asserts that every file listed here",
    "actually exists on disk, so the two artifacts cannot drift apart.",
    "Images are intentionally shared between products - there are 51 assets for 3000+",
    "products. Do not generate one image per product."
  ],
